    "contrib": "The state Old Age Grant is funded from general taxation with no contribution. For formal-sector employees, voluntary occupational retirement funds and Retirement Annuities (RA) are the main vehicles: RA contributions are tax-deductible up to 27.5% of income (cap R350,000 per year), shared between employee and employer in workplace funds. The two-pot system splits new contributions one-third to a savings pot and two-thirds to a preserved retirement pot. No mandatory national contributory pension exists yet, though a National Social Security Fund (NSSF) proposal has been discussed.",
    "contrib_zh": "国家老年津贴由一般税收支付，无需缴费。正规部门受雇者主要依靠自愿性职业退休基金和个人退休年金（RA）：RA缴费可在收入27.5%以内税前扣除（上限每年35万兰特），职场基金由雇员与雇主分担。两池制将新缴费的三分之一划入储蓄池、三分之二划入保留的退休池。目前尚无强制性全国缴费型养老金，但已讨论设立国家社会保障基金（NSSF）的提议。",
    "recent_reform": "The two-pot retirement system took effect on 1 September 2024, a major structural reform splitting contributions into an accessible savings pot (one-third) and a preserved retirement pot (two-thirds). In 2025 Parliament passed the Revenue Laws Amendment Bill clarifying technical ambiguities in the two-pot rules, such as the seeding-date calculation and provident-fund exclusions. In the 2026/27 Budget the annual Retirement Annuity deduction cap was raised from R350,000 to R430,000 (27.5% rate unchanged), and the third savings-pot withdrawal window opened on 1 March 2026; by mid-2025 about 4 million two-pot withdrawals totalling roughly R57 billion had been processed. National Treasury (March 2026) is weighing limited access to the preservation pot for members in dire financial distress under strict conditions, and flagged auto-enrolment into retirement funds as the next step; by February 2026 about R79.3bn had been approved for savings-pot withdrawal across 5.6m people, with preservation up about 33% versus the pre-two-pot era (Old Mutual).",
    "recent_reform_zh": "两池制退休体系于2024年9月1日生效，是一项重大结构性改革，将缴费拆分为可支取的储蓄池（三分之一）和保留的退休池（三分之二）。2025年议会通过《税收法律修正案》，厘清两池制规则中的技术模糊之处，如种子金额计算日期及公积金例外情形。 2026/27年度预算将退休年金（RA）税前扣除上限由35万兰特提高至43万兰特（27.5%税率不变）；储蓄池第三个提取窗口于2026年3月1日开启。截至2025年中，两池制约已处理约400万笔储蓄池提取、合计约570亿兰特。 国家财政部（2026年3月）正研究在严格条件下允许陷入严重财务困境的会员动用保留池，并将自动加入退休基金列为两池制之后的下一步；截至2026年2月，储蓄池已批准约793亿兰特提取、涉及560万人，保留率较两池制前提高约33%（Old Mutual数据）。 2026/27预算自4月起将老年、残疾及照料依赖津贴各提高80兰特至2,400兰特/月（60–74岁）与2,420兰特（75岁以上）；SASSA强化生物识别与收入核查，终止近3.5万份欺诈性津贴。 2026/27预算自4月起将老年、残疾及照料依赖津贴各提高80兰特至2,400兰特/月（60–74岁）与2,420兰特（75岁以上）；SASSA强化生物识别与收入核查，终止近3.5万份欺诈性津贴。"
